-> Emission handlers react to what organelles say back — every Log and
-> Exception emitted anywhere in the cell lands here.

Log { source ∈ String, level ∈ String, message ∈ String } => {
    emit logger.Log { message = "[" + source + "] " + message, level = level } to logger
}

Exception { source ∈ String, message ∈ String } => {
    emit logger.Log { message = "[EXCEPTION:" + source + "] " + message, level = "Error" } to logger
}
